  "description": "Jiro.Commands is a comprehensive framework for building command-based applications with plugin support. It provides a robust foundation for creating extensible .NET applications with dynamic command loading, type-safe parameter parsing, and flexible result handling.\n\nFeatures:\n• Dynamic command registration and execution\n• Plugin-based architecture with hot-loading capabilities\n• Advanced parameter parsing with type conversion\n• Multiple result types (Text, JSON, Image, Graph)\n• Quote-aware command tokenization\n• Comprehensive error handling and validation\n• Full dependency injection support\n• XML documentation for excellent IntelliSense support",
